Menu="UserPreferences"
Title="Aether Glass"
Icon="aether-glass.png"
Markdown="false"
---
<?php
/* Aether Glass Settings page: shows the theme's status and offers its buttons.
 * Each button posts to Unraid's own /update.php, which runs apply.sh with fixed
 * arguments.  update.php only runs scripts inside the webGUI folder and quotes the
 * arguments, and apply.sh rejects anything that isn't one of its known options and values.
 * No JavaScript: the theme is CSS only, and so is this page.
 */
$apply  = '/usr/local/emhttp/plugins/aether-glass/apply.sh';
$status = shell_exec(escapeshellarg($apply).' --status 2>&1');

// Current effect levels, read from the status text (apply.sh is the only thing that
// writes effects.cfg, and it only writes known values)
preg_match('/^Effects:\s+(\w+) \(motion (\w+), glass (\w+), glow (\w+)\)/m', $status ?? '', $fx);
[$preset, $motion, $glass, $glow] = [$fx[1] ?? 'balanced', $fx[2] ?? 'hover', $fx[3] ?? 'all', $fx[4] ?? 'all'];

// One dropdown; marks the current value as selected
function ag_select($name, $current, $options) {
  $html = "<select name=\"".htmlspecialchars($name)."\">";
  foreach ($options as $value => $label) {
    $sel = ($value === $current) ? ' selected' : '';
    $html .= "<option value=\"".htmlspecialchars($value)."\"$sel>".htmlspecialchars($label)."</option>";
  }
  return $html."</select>";
}
?>
<style>
#aether-glass-status { font-family: ui-monospace, Menlo, Consolas, monospace; white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 1.6; }
.aether-glass-actions form { display: inline-block; margin-right: 1rem; }
.aether-glass-effects form { margin: 0 0 1rem; }
.aether-glass-effects label { display: inline-block; min-width: 9rem; }
.aether-glass-effects dl { display: grid; grid-template-columns: max-content 1fr; gap: 0.3rem 1rem; margin: 0.5rem 0 1rem; }
.aether-glass-effects dt { font-weight: bold; }
.aether-glass-effects dd { margin: 0; }
</style>

<p>An unofficial deep-violet frosted-glass theme for the webGUI.  It changes how pages look and nothing else.
Main pages need <b>Settings -> Display Settings -> Dynamix color theme = Black</b>; the login page is themed on any setting.</p>

<p><b>Update pause:</b> the theme only loads on the Unraid version you approved.  After installing, and after every
Unraid update, it stays off until you look over the stock pages and click <b>Approve</b>.</p>

<div id="aether-glass-status"><?=htmlspecialchars($status ?? 'apply.sh did not answer')?></div>

<div class="aether-glass-actions">
  <form method="POST" action="/update.php" target="progressFrame">
    <input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="<?=$var['csrf_token']?>">
    <input type="hidden" name="#command" value="<?=$apply?>">
    <input type="hidden" name="#arg[0]" value="--approve">
    <input type="submit" value="Approve this version and turn on">
  </form>
  <form method="POST" action="/update.php" target="progressFrame">
    <input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="<?=$var['csrf_token']?>">
    <input type="hidden" name="#command" value="<?=$apply?>">
    <input type="hidden" name="#arg[0]" value="--disable">
    <input type="submit" value="Turn off (stays off after reboot)">
  </form>
  <form method="POST" action="/update.php" target="progressFrame">
    <input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="<?=$var['csrf_token']?>">
    <input type="hidden" name="#command" value="<?=$apply?>">
    <input type="hidden" name="#arg[0]" value="--enable">
    <input type="submit" value="Turn back on">
  </form>
</div>

<h3>Effects</h3>
<div class="aether-glass-effects">
<p>Trade looks for speed on slower computers.  Every level still follows each visitor's own computer: if it asks for
less motion or less transparency (macOS and Windows accessibility settings), that visitor gets it anyway.</p>

<dl>
  <dt>Best looks</dt><dd>Lava moves on every title, frosted glass everywhere, all glows.</dd>
  <dt>Balanced</dt><dd>Lava moves on the tile you point at.  Recommended, and the default.</dd>
  <dt>Fast</dt><dd>Also: small buttons get a plain fill instead of blur, and no glows on bars and live numbers.</dd>
  <dt>Fastest</dt><dd>Nothing moves, no frosted glass (solid panels), no glows.</dd>
</dl>

<form method="POST" action="/update.php" target="progressFrame">
  <input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="<?=$var['csrf_token']?>">
  <input type="hidden" name="#command" value="<?=$apply?>">
  <input type="hidden" name="#arg[0]" value="--effects">
  <label>Preset</label>
  <?=ag_select('#arg[1]', "preset=$preset", ['preset=best' => 'Best looks', 'preset=balanced' => 'Balanced', 'preset=fast' => 'Fast', 'preset=fastest' => 'Fastest'] + ($preset === 'custom' ? ['preset=custom' => 'Custom (fine-tuned below)'] : []))?>
  <input type="submit" value="Apply preset">
</form>

<form method="POST" action="/update.php" target="progressFrame">
  <input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="<?=$var['csrf_token']?>">
  <input type="hidden" name="#command" value="<?=$apply?>">
  <input type="hidden" name="#arg[0]" value="--effects">
  <p><b>Fine-tune</b> (overrides the preset):</p>
  <label>Motion</label><?=ag_select('#arg[1]', "motion=$motion", ['motion=everywhere' => 'Every title', 'motion=hover' => 'Title you point at', 'motion=still' => 'Still'])?><br>
  <label>Frosted glass</label><?=ag_select('#arg[2]', "glass=$glass", ['glass=all' => 'Everything', 'glass=panels' => 'Panels only', 'glass=off' => 'Off (solid panels)'])?><br>
  <label>Glows</label><?=ag_select('#arg[3]', "glow=$glow", ['glow=all' => 'All', 'glow=static' => 'Not on live bars and numbers', 'glow=off' => 'Off'])?><br>
  <input type="submit" value="Apply these settings">
</form>
</div>

<p>Reload the page after a change.  If it still looks the same, reload while holding Shift.
If the webGUI is unreachable, create an empty file named <code>DISABLED</code> in
<code>config/plugins/aether-glass/</code> on the flash drive and reboot: the theme will not load.</p>
